<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="back-for-combat-rogue-dps">
<span class="c4">Back for Combat Rogue DPS</span></h4>While you can pick up <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=67134/dorys-finery">
<img alt="Dory's Finery" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_cataclysm_melee_d_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Dory's Finery</span></a> as a BoE from a world boss or <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=58191/viewless-wings">
<img alt="Viewless Wings" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_cataclysm_melee_d_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Viewless Wings</span></a> from valor points, the most realistic options that you will aim for in pre-bis will be <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62361/softwind-cape">
<img alt="Softwind Cape" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_cataclysm_melee_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Softwind Cape</span></a> or <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=65177/cape-of-the-brotherhood">
<img alt="Cape of the Brotherhood" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_cataclysm_melee_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Cape of the Brotherhood</span></a>.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Cloak Enchant</b>: <a class="q1 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=44457/enchant-cloak-major-agility">
<img alt="Enchant Cloak - Major Agility" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_enchantedscroll.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Cloak - Major Agility</span></a> or <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=75178/swordguard-embroidery">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_thread_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Swordguard Embroidery</span></a> if you have chosen tailoring.<div class="pad"></div>
