<img alt="Morrie's Waywalker Wrap" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_leather_raiddruid_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Morrie's Waywalker Wrap</span></a> having a slight edge. The best non-crafted option would be <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=63468/defias-brotherhood-vest">
