<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="wrist-for-combat-rogue-dps">
<span class="c4">Wrist for Combat Rogue DPS</span></h4>There are really only 2 good pre-bis bracer options and <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56409/poison-fang-bracers">
<img alt="Poison Fang Bracers" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_82.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Poison Fang Bracers</span></a> wins out here with the slightly better secondary stats.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Bracer Enchant</b>: <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=68784/enchant-bracer-agility">
<img alt="Enchant Bracer - Agility" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_enchantedscroll.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Bracer - Agility</span></a>
<div class="pad"></div>
