<span class="c4">Hands for Combat Rogue DPS</span></h4>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=60459/vicious-gladiators-leather-gloves">
<img alt="Vicious Gladiator's Leather Gloves" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_glove_leather_pvprogue_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Vicious Gladiator's Leather Gloves</span></a> is the other piece that you'd want to use to unlock the PvP 2-set. Any other slots would result in a loss of more stats than the set bonus can negate. The second option is an easy choice in <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62417/liars-handwraps">
