<img alt="Stormbolt Gloves" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_glove_leatherraidrogue_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Stormbolt Gloves</span></a> dependent upon your faction.<br/>
<br/>
