<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="feet-for-combat-rogue-dps">
<span class="c4">Feet for Combat Rogue DPS</span></h4>The technical pre-bis here would be <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=58482/treads-of-fleeting-joy">
<img alt="Treads of Fleeting Joy" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boot_leatherraidrogue_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Treads of Fleeting Joy</span></a>, but requires you to either level a 2nd character to farm valor points to funnel this item to your main or spend a good chunk of gold for those looking to sell these early on for profit. The much more realistic options lie in <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56395/craftys-gaiters">
<img alt="Crafty's Gaiters" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_leather_15.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Crafty's Gaiters</span></a> or <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=65178/vancleefs-boots">
<img alt="VanCleef's Boots" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_leather_15.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">VanCleef's Boots</span></a>.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Feet Enchant</b>: <a class="q1 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=52781/enchant-boots-assassins-step">
