<div class="pad"></div>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="neck-for-combat-rogue-dps">
<span class="c4">Neck for Combat Rogue DPS</span></h4>Just like the cloak slot, the technical pre-bis here would be <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=67137/don-rodrigos-fabulous-necklace">
<img alt="Don Rodrigo's Fabulous Necklace" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_necklacea9.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Don Rodrigo's Fabulous Necklace</span></a> as a BoE from a world boss. The much more realistic options here would be either <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56422/mouth-of-the-earth">
<img alt="Mouth of the Earth" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_necklacea11.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Mouth of the Earth</span></a> or <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62378/acorn-of-the-daughter-tree">
<img alt="Acorn of the Daughter Tree" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_food_pinenut.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Acorn of the Daughter Tree</span></a>.<div class="pad"></div>
