<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="trinkets-for-combat-rogue-dps">
<span class="c4">Trinkets for Combat Rogue DPS</span></h4>Every scrap of valor points that you have early on should go into getting the very powerful <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=58181/fluid-death">
<img alt="Fluid Death" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_vehicle_liquidpyrite_blue.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fluid Death</span></a>. Your second trinket as combat will prefer to be <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56427/left-eye-of-rajh">
<img alt="Left Eye of Rajh" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_dragonseye02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Left Eye of Rajh</span></a> for the extra expertise to play with, but <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56394/tias-grace">
<img alt="Tia's Grace" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_ammo_arrow_05.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Tia's Grace</span></a> and <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56328/key-to-the-endless-chamber">
<img alt="Key to the Endless Chamber" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_key_10.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Key to the Endless Chamber</span></a> are viable choices in that slot.<div class="pad"></div>
