<br/>
<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="weapons">
<span class="c4">Weapons for Combat Rogue DPS</span></h3>
<div class="pad"></div>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="main-hand-weapons-for-combat-rogue-dps">
<span class="c4">Main Hand Weapons for Combat Rogue DPS</span></h4>There are two very distinct pre-bis options for combat; <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=68161/krol-decapitator">
<img alt="Krol Decapitator" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_sword_18.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Krol Decapitator</span></a> requires a whole lot of pickpocketing and some good luck on your side, while <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=65164/cruel-barb">
<img alt="Cruel Barb" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_sword_24.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Cruel Barb</span></a> just requires you to farm out <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=6510/the-deadmines">
<span class="tinyicontxt">The Deadmines</span></a>. <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=65164/cruel-barb">
<img alt="Cruel Barb" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_sword_24.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Cruel Barb</span></a> is the only agility 1-handed weapon in all of Cataclysm that has a weapon speed above 2.6 which makes this the automatic pre-bis when not factoring in the RNG dependant <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=68161/krol-decapitator">
<img alt="Krol Decapitator" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_sword_18.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Krol Decapitator</span></a>.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Weapon Enchants</b>: <a class="q1 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=52776/enchant-weapon-landslide">
<img alt="Enchant Weapon - Landslide" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_enchantedscroll.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Weapon - Landslide</span></a>. Your main-hand poison will be <a class="q1 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=6947/instant-poison">
<img alt="Instant Poison" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_poisons.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Instant Poison</span></a>
<div class="pad"></div>
<table class="grid max-width">
<tbody>
<tr>
<td data-background="c4" style="width: 10%; max-width: 100%;">
<b>Rank</b></td>
<td data-background="c4" style="width: 25%; max-width: 100%;">
<b>Item</b></td>
<td data-background="c4" style="width: 20%; max-width: 100%;">
<b>Sockets</b></td>
<td data-background="c4" style="width: 23%; max-width: 100%;">
<b>Source</b></td>
<td data-background="c4" style="width: 22%; max-width: 100%;">
<b>Location</b></td></tr>
<tr>
<td>Best</td>
<td>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=68161/krol-decapitator">
<img alt="Krol Decapitator" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_sword_18.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Krol Decapitator</span></a></td>
<td>
<span class="fa fa-minus fa-color-gray"></span></td>
<td>BoE from <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=5967/pickpocket-pt">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Pickpocket (PT)</span></a></td>
