<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="off-hand-weapons-for-combat-rogue-dps">
<span class="c4">Off Hand Weapons for Combat Rogue DPS</span></h4>All of the off hand options are relatively close to one another, but <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56335/quicksilver-blade">
<img alt="Quicksilver Blade" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_knife_1h_cataclysm_c_04.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Quicksilver Blade</span></a> does win out with better secondary stats.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Weapon Enchants</b>: <a class="q1 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=52776/enchant-weapon-landslide">
<img alt="Enchant Weapon - Landslide" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_enchantedscroll.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Weapon - Landslide</span></a>. Your off-hand poison will be <a class="q1 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=2892/deadly-poison">
<img alt="Deadly Poison" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_rogue_dualweild.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Deadly Poison</span></a>
