<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="guns-bows-and-thrown-weapons-for-combat-rogue-dps">
<span class="c4">Guns, Bows, and Thrown Weapons for Combat Rogue DPS</span></h4>Your best in slot ends up being the crafted engi gun <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=59367/kickback-5000">
