<img alt="Spinerender" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_weapon_shortblade_24.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Spinerender</span></a>.<div class="pad"></div>
<b>Recommended BiS Ranged Poison</b>: If you do have a thrown equipped, your poison will be <a class="q1 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=10918/wound-poison">
